skill_gaps_summary: "The candidate lacks the necessary experience level for a senior position, with only 2 years of professional experience. There are significant technical gaps in crucial backend development areas including web frameworks (FastAPI/Django), REST API development, database management, and containerization. While they have Python experience, it's primarily in research/academic context rather than production backend development."
strengths[5]: Strong computer science foundation,Python programming experience,Git version control proficiency,Testing experience,Algorithm implementation skills
strengths_reason: "The candidate demonstrates solid theoretical knowledge through their CS education and shows practical experience with Python programming, version control, and testing. Their GitHub projects, particularly the pathfinding implementation, showcase ability to work with algorithms."
