detailed_feedback: "The candidate shows promise with a strong computer science background and fundamental programming skills, particularly in Python and version control. Their experience with testing and algorithm implementation demonstrates good technical foundations.\n\nHowever, there are significant gaps between their current experience level and the requirements for a senior backend developer position. With only 2 years of professional experience and no direct backend development work, they lack the depth needed for a senior role. Their technical stack is missing crucial components like web frameworks, API development, and database management.\n\nThe GitHub profile shows mainly academic and learning projects, without production-level backend development work. While the code quality in existing projects is reasonable, they lack important production considerations like error handling, documentation, and proper testing."
hiring_manager_notes: "While this candidate shows good potential and strong fundamentals, they are not currently suitable for a senior backend developer position. Their experience level (2 years) and skill gaps in key backend technologies make them too junior for this role.\n\nConsider keeping their profile for future junior backend developer positions. They would benefit from gaining experience with web frameworks, API development, and database management. Their strong CS foundation and learning ability suggest good potential for growth.\n\nIf pursuing further discussions, recommend focusing on their willingness to learn backend technologies and potential for a more junior role."